OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's anger at delays to review
OL,4,Aof stab death case
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a Fife man who died from
OL,7,Fa stab wound to the chest have hit out
OL,8,Fat delays to a review of the case by
OL,9,Fprosecutors.
OL,11,FColin Marr, 23, died from a single blow
OL,12,Ffrom a kitchen knife in 2007 after a
OL,13,Frow with his fiancee.
OL,15,FHis family have long challenged the
OL,16,Foriginal police ruling that it was
OL,17,Fsuicide and a Crown Office and
OL,18,FProcurator Fiscal Service (COPFS)
OL,19,Fforensic and pathology review which
OL,20,Fstarted in 2023 has still not finished.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
